/T (Review of the above work reveals a persistent gap: existing systems either provide accurate but unexplainable predictions, or explainable but easily evaded static rules, and very few accept non-textual input such as screenshots. The proposed system addresses this gap by fusing the two paradigms in a single hybrid engine and adding multi-modal \(text + image\) input with OCR.)
/E (Review of the above work reveals a persistent gap: existing systems either provide accurate but unexplainable predictions, or explainable but easily evaded static rules, and very few accept non-textual input such as screenshots. The proposed system addresses this gap by fusing the two paradigms in a single hybrid engine and adding multi-modal \(text + image\) input with OCR.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
