<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 62 0 R
/T (Key features include multi-modal input, real-time analysis, explainable AI output, heuristic boosting, and a premium dark-mode glassmorphism interface. The intended users are individual internet users, students, small and medium enterprises without dedicated security infrastructure, and IT help-desks that need a quick, transparent tool for triaging suspicious emails.)
/E (Key features include multi-modal input, real-time analysis, explainable AI output, heuristic boosting, and a premium dark-mode glassmorphism interface. The intended users are individual internet users, students, small and medium enterprises without dedicated security infrastructure, and IT help-desks that need a quick, transparent tool for triaging suspicious emails.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [4]
>>
