163 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 62 0 R
/T (In the short term the system can serve as a browser-accessible utility for verifying suspicious emails. Future extensions include: analysing email headers and sender-domain reputation; browser extension and email-client plugin integration for automatic scanning of inboxes; multilingual phishing detection; deployment of deep-learning models such as LSTM or transformer-based classifiers; URL reputation checking through external threat-intelligence APIs; and a feedback mechanism that lets users report missed phishing attempts, enabling continuous retraining and improvement of the model.)
/E (In the short term the system can serve as a browser-accessible utility for verifying suspicious emails. Future extensions include: analysing email headers and sender-domain reputation; browser extension and email-client plugin integration for automatic scanning of inboxes; multilingual phishing detection; deployment of deep-learning models such as LSTM or transformer-based classifiers; URL reputation checking through external threat-intelligence APIs; and a feedback mechanism that lets users report missed phishing attempts, enabling continuous retraining and improvement of the model.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [6]
>>
