>>
endobj
497 0 obj
<<
/Title (Review of the above work reveals a persistent gap: existing systems either provide accurate but unexplainable predictions, or explainable but easily evaded static rules, and very few accept non-textual input such as screenshots. The proposed system addresses this gap by fusing the two paradigms in a single hybrid engine and adding multi-modal \(text + image\) input with OCR.)
/Dest [15 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 400 0 R
/Prev 593 0 R
>>
endobj
